<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A10" title="In VideoNSA: Native Sparse Attention Scales Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">J </span>More results on attention scaling study</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A11" title="In VideoNSA: Native Sparse Attention Scales Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">K </span>Full Gate Values Distribution</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A12" title="In VideoNSA: Native Sparse Attention Scales Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L </span>More Inter-head Gate Similarites Visualization</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A13" title="In VideoNSA: Native Sparse Attention Scales Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">M </span>More Analysis about Attention Sinks on Various Sparse Attention Settings</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A14" title="In VideoNSA: Native Sparse Attention Scales Video Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">N </span>Dense Attention Sink Visualization</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
  <a id="license-tr" href="https://info.arxiv.org/help/license/index.html#licenses-available">
