<th id="S3.T1.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding:0.25pt 3.6pt;">InternVL2.5-8B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al. (2024b)</a></cite></th>
<td id="S3.T1.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.25pt 3.6pt;"><span id="S3.T1.2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">60.0</span></td>
